      "HotelName": "Doubletree By Hilton Fujairah City",
      "Description": "<p><strong>Hotel Overview:</strong> A beacon of eco-friendly luxury, Doubletree By Hilton Fujairah City blends modern architectural design with sustainable practices. Nestled in the heart of Fujairah, this hotel is recognized for its commitment to environmental sustainability without compromising on luxury or comfort.</p><p><strong>Accommodations:</strong> Doubletree By Hilton Fujairah City caters to a variety of travelers with its richly appointed rooms and suites. Guests can enjoy a comfortable stay in one of the 229 elegantly appointed guestrooms. The hotel boasts a variety of room types including Deluxe Rooms, Executive Suites, and Presidential Suites. Each room features memory foam beds draped in premium bedding, marble bathrooms with exclusive toiletries, and balconies offering mesmerizing views of the city or garden. In-room amenities include high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs, and well-stocked minibars.</p><p><strong>Amenities:</strong> Guests at Doubletree By Hilton enjoy a plethora of luxurious amenities including 24-hour concierge services, valet parking, private cabana rentals by the poolside, sophisticated business centers and exclusive VIP services such as butler and limousine rentals tailored to enhance each stay.</p><p><strong>Dining Options:</strong> The hotel features three exquisite dining venues including The Orchard Restaurant serving international cuisines The Skyview Bar which offers panoramic city views along with fine wines and cocktails and La Terrazza for authentic Italian dishes. Exclusive dining experiences such as rooftop dining bespoke wine pairings and gourmet tasting menus are also available.</p><p><strong>Nearby Location & Transportation:</strong> The hotel is conveniently located just 5 kilometers from Fujairah International Airport and close to major train stations making it easily accessible for both international and local travelers.</p><p><strong>Nearby Attractions:</strong></p><p><ul><li>Fujairah Mall - 2.3 km away offers a premium shopping experience</li><li>Sheikh Zayed Mosque - Just 1 km away encapsulates splendid architectural design</li></ul></p><p><strong>Wellness And Activities:</strong> For relaxation Doubletree By Hilton houses an expansive wellness center featuring a full-service spa offering signature treatments hydrotherapy sessions yoga classes in serene settings fitness center equipped with state-of-the-art machines outdoor swimming pools designed for ultimate leisurely experiences.</p><p><strong>Policies & Check-In Instructions:</strong></p><p><ul><li>Check-in time starts at 3 PM Minimum check-in age is 21 Early check-in subject to availability Government-issued photo ID required</li><li>Pets not allowed This property accepts major credit cards cash</li><li>Special requests are subject to availability upon check-in might incur additional charges</li></ul></p><p><strong>Summary:</strong> Situated near key landmarks Doubletree By Hilton Fujairah City stands out for its eco-friendly operations luxurious accommodations top-tier amenities making it ideal for business travelers families seeking an exquisite travel experience.</p><br/><b>Disclaimer notification: Amenities are subject to availability and may be chargeable as per the hotel policy.</b>",
